<title>CHINA: Theme Int'l yearly net jumps 196 percent.</title>
<headline>Theme Int'l yearly net jumps 196 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   18.98  vs 8.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0    vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    90.77  vs 30.64</p>
<p>    Turnover		     884.90 vs 741.96</p>
<p>    Company name		 Theme International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 23-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Theme International is a fashion retailer.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is seven H.K. cents (including interim dividend of five cents) vs five cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
